[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:61. A Bad Cold]
[00:00.940]Lesson 61 | 第61课
[00:03.315]Where's Jimmy? | 吉米在哪里？
[00:05.380]He's in bed. | 他在床上。
[00:06.725]What's the matter with him? | 他怎么了？
[00:07.945]He feels ill. | 他感觉不舒服。
[00:10.240]He looks ill. | 他看起来不舒服。
[00:12.385]We must call the doctor. | 我们必须叫医生。
[00:14.345]Yes, we must. | 是的，我们必须。
[00:16.545]Can you remember the doctor's telephone number? | 你能记住医生的电话号码吗？
[00:20.305]Yes. | 是的。
[00:21.405]It's 09754. | 是09754。
[00:24.995]Open your mouth, Jimmy. | 张开嘴，吉米。
[00:27.880]Show me your tongue. | 给我看看你的舌头。
[00:30.180]Say ah. | 说“啊”。
[00:33.000]What's the matter with him, doctor? | 医生，他怎么了？
[00:35.770]He has a bad cold, Mr. Williams. | 他得了重感冒，威廉姆斯先生。
[00:38.985]So he must stay in bed for a week. | 所以他必须卧床一周。
[00:42.060]That's good news for Jimmy. | 这对吉米来说是个好消息。
[00:44.730]Good news? | 好消息？
[00:46.260]Why? | 为什么？
[00:47.250]Because he doesn't like school. | 因为他不喜欢学校。